                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4296dc40-dca1-415b-bbce-30ece0ca3050",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: aura"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "839f646f-f074-4fb2-9966-770a0ddd2a23",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "negative rizz, L rizz",
                                                "translation": "disastrously poor rizz; the ability to repel others",
                                                "english": "disastrously poor rizz; the ability to repel others"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5134595c-a4a8-47fb-9d11-065e72da1033",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "Wow, that guy has no rizz whatsoever."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13ca7a67-2f0e-4f55-a63f-9afdea8a0508",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "You got her number? W rizz!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80796d26-c450-4834-aabb-b50edf4d6b34",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "Bruh, that girl has better rizz than I do."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95eab7a4-1ec9-46a5-8c9c-fd65d536d942",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "Baby Gronk shared that he would be focusing not on grade school or a paper route but ... his love for video games. To be fair, the purported \"rizz king\" of the pre-pubescent sports world is probably not the one who actually said any of the above."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26cd95f2-64e8-4f1e-bd6c-0c0f149b2bfa",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "On Monday, Hill posted a TikTok using a filter which rated her 'rizz level', with it giving her 96/100 and 'rizz god' status."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a04dcd7-b2b0-4ad8-a329-0d03b0957e1a",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "By now we all know how stilted and off-kilter ChatGPT sounds: blind confidence and a lack of shame can get you far in life, but could it really have more 'rizz' than even the most stilted and awkward human?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60b8c7e8-251f-42b2-af94-2e99ec1434e9",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "As it turns out, Zendaya's rizz-o-meter needed to scan beyond the bounds of Arrakis to hone in on who had the most rizz of all."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ef62d03-0715-456a-a842-115067b9224d",
                                                "sense_id": "21ba80cb-b5f5-332c-9b5a-803ae622bdee",
                                                "text": "While Glinda chases boys with rizz."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
