                                                "example_id": "0d528784-3cda-449c-b9fa-c13273162c8f",
                                                "sense_id": "b2fd0bd5-d1ff-31dc-bcfb-180138cd650d",
                                                "text": "In one of De Tolla's videos, he says that Dunne \"rizzed\" Madden while convincing him to attend LSU. In another video, he jokes that Madden \"rizzed up\" Dunne and the 10-year-old stole the gymnastics star from her boyfriend, the \"drip king.\" \"Drip\" refers to swagger and style."
                                            }
                                        ]
